      "originalText": "Two years into production: sub-50ms latency for 1MB blobs, 88% of network bandwidth used, disk load balanced 8-10x better.\n10,000 requests/sec sustained across 400M+ LinkedIn members. Open-sourced in 2016. Failure detection: zero extra cost -- inferred from live request traffic, no heartbeats.",
